  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1720192797_2197372_d8bffd0f83f7437d087a85392f3b50c3.jpg",
  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Hello!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">We are lootoo. A brand dedicated to providing lovers of the outdoors the comforts of home on their adventures!&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">We are looking for creators to help promote the brand, sharing our product's unique features and benefits with their audiences.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">We are part of a larger group of outdoor brands; primarily rooftop tents (escapade4x4.co.uk) &amp; swing away tent (swingawaytent.com). Chosen creators will also have the opportunity to work with these brands, if the relationship fits both audiences.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">We hope to speak with you soon!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The lootoo Team!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>Product description:</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">The Lootoo&trade;️ portable collapsible stool - your go-to solution for hassle-free seating outdoors. Perfect for campers, families with children, and the elderly, this stool prioritises simplicity, cleanliness, and ease of use.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Crafted with durable materials, it offers reliability without the bulkiness of traditional seating options. Its telescopic design allows for simple height adjustment, ensuring comfort for all heights!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Maximum weight capacity:&nbsp;<strong>300kg</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Dimensions:&nbsp;(Max) H<strong>50cm</strong>&nbsp;x W<strong>38cm</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Used with our Super Absorbant Polymer sachets. Apply the powder before use, do your business, let science do the rest!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Cleanup is simple with the Lootoo&trade;️, simply wipe it down with a damp cloth and it's ready for the next use. Lightweight and compact, it's easy to carry and store, making it a practical addition to any outdoor adventure.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><em>Includes: Super Absorbant Powder x 1 + Bin Bags (20) x 1</em></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><br><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The lootoo packs away into a convenient small size, is telescopic (collapsible) to fit any comfort size, can double as a bin &amp; a seat!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br><strong>Payment terms:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We offer all major forms of payment. Please let us know if you require additional arragements.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>",
